    {
      "title": "Show HN: EterDB, a Postgres fork that makes it easy to recover from incidents",
      "url": "https://eterdb.com/",
      "summary": "<p>Hey everyone, a few months ago, after recovering from a Clade-generated bug, I was thinking to myself \u201cwouldn\u2019t it be nice if prod DB writes were easy to roll back\u201d. I\u2019ve put something together: it\u2019s a two-container deploy plus a CLI tool. It\u2019s far from being production ready, so please be gentle",
